2463215","x":9.8e-05,"y":1.0,"t":1735477590,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:06:30.000Z","rt":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"likes":0,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"ayubsohail14","author_id":"1031821475962019841","text":"@amitbhawani Anything related to chicken 😭","in_corpus":false,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":0,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.019,"parent_id":"1873354627812602088","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354631419765244","x":1e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477524,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:24.000Z","rt":3,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":30,"relation":"reply","niveau":1,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"What’s Happening?\nHospitals Overwhelmed: Pediatric, adult cases of pneumonia &amp; severe respiratory infections have surged by 40%, especially in Beijing.\n\nViruses in Play:\nInfluenza A (H3N2 and others)\nHMPV: A major cause of severe respiratory illnesses\nAvian Flu (H5N1, H10N3) /2","in_corpus":true,"depth":1,"subtree_rt":12,"subtree_size":10,"dt_root_h":0.0,"parent_id":"1873354627812602088","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354634347397306","x":1e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477524,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:24.000Z","rt":2,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":20,"relation":"reply","niveau":2,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"Avian Influenza Updates 🦠\n\nH10N3: First human case detected in Jiangsu, China, in 2021. Rare in humans, mainly seen in wild birds.\n\nH5N1:\n→61 global human cases since April 2024.\n→ 1 severe human case in the U.S. confirmed in Dec 2024. /3","in_corpus":false,"depth":2,"subtree_rt":9,"subtree_size":9,"dt_root_h":0.0,"parent_id":"1873354631419765244","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354637199462555","x":3e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477525,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:25.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":18,"relation":"reply","niveau":3,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"Human Metapneumovirus (HMPV)\n\n→ Spiking globally, this virus causes severe respiratory illness, particularly in children, the elderly, and immunocompromised people.\n→ Up to 30% positivity in respiratory tests this season. /4","in_corpus":true,"depth":3,"subtree_rt":7,"subtree_size":8,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1873354634347397306","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354640605258235","x":4e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477526,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:26.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":17,"relation":"reply","niveau":4,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"Actions Taken in China 🇨🇳\n\n→ A pilot system for detecting pneumonia of unknown origins, focusing on faster case reporting and verification.\n→ Vaccination Campaigns: Nationwide drives for flu vaccines to curb spread.\n→ Healthcare Expansion: Increased hospital capacity. /5","in_corpus":false,"depth":4,"subtree_rt":6,"subtree_size":7,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1873354637199462555","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354643608416555","x":4e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477526,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:26.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":21,"relation":"reply","niveau":5,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"Global Coordination 🌍\n\n→ #WHO is in talks with Chinese health authorities for detailed updates.\n→ Neighboring countries have tightened airport screenings for travelers from China.\n→ Vaccine readiness being ramped up for potential avian flu outbreaks. /6","in_corpus":false,"depth":5,"subtree_rt":5,"subtree_size":6,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1873354640605258235","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354646460469341","x":6e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477527,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:27.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":19,"relation":"reply","niveau":6,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"Key Numbers 📊\n\n→ Influenza surge: 40–50% rise in hospital admissions in China.\n→ H5N1: 61 cases globally since April 2024.\n→ HMPV: Detected in ~30% of global respiratory samples this season. /7","in_corpus":true,"depth":6,"subtree_rt":4,"subtree_size":5,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1873354643608416555","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354649530708306","x":7e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477528,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:28.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":18,"relation":"reply","niveau":7,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"What Experts Say\n\n→ Current situation involves known pathogens, unlike COVID-19’s early days.\n→ Public health measures (masks, hygiene, avoiding crowds) remain critical.\n→ Authorities stress vigilance but advise against panic. /8","in_corpus":false,"depth":7,"subtree_rt":3,"subtree_size":4,"dt_root_h":0.001,"parent_id":"1873354646460469341","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354652349354194","x":9e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477529,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:29.000Z","rt":1,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":17,"relation":"reply","niveau":8,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"While respiratory illnesses in China raise alarms, there’s no evidence of a novel virus. Vigilance, swift actions, and coordinated efforts are essential to managing this situation. \n\nStay informed and take preventive measures. /9","in_corpus":false,"depth":8,"subtree_rt":2,"subtree_size":3,"dt_root_h":0.002,"parent_id":"1873354649530708306","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354655239217401","x":9e-06,"y":0.0,"t":1735477529,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:29.000Z","rt":0,"replies":1,"quotes":0,"likes":14,"relation":"reply","niveau":9,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"For those seeking more info:\n\nDec 18th, 2024 - CDC - https://t.co/vRtQsSdZ8g\n\nDec 20th, 2024 - WHO - https://t.co/7qgUfmItou\n\nDec 27th, 2024 - Reuters - https://t.co/D8JPehQjOp\n\n/10","in_corpus":false,"depth":9,"subtree_rt":1,"subtree_size":2,"dt_root_h":0.002,"parent_id":"1873354652349354194","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"},{"id":"1873354658187763874","x":1e-05,"y":0.0,"t":1735477530,"iso":"2024-12-29T13:05:30.000Z","rt":1,"replies":0,"quotes":1,"likes":28,"relation":"reply","niveau":10,"author":"amitbhawani","author_id":"13625042","text":"NOTE: This information comes from various online sources. You’re free to ignore it, but like with the last pandemic, where early signs were overlooked, I prefer staying informed rather than ignoring things and getting shocked later.\n\nLet's stay safe!","in_corpus":false,"depth":10,"subtree_rt":1,"subtree_size":1,"dt_root_h":0.002,"parent_id":"1873354655239217401","conversation_id":"1873354627812602088"}],"edges":[{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873354631419765244","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873354909682463215","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873356110020952259","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873356838709981590","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873360564631790077","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873364965241078205","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873367691370881216","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873374567248630181","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873377806870327661","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873387145165205803","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873402092133458377","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873431537129234939","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873434965930852397","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873437706145206621","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873442223553212486","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873447761213108243","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target":"1873453472240275532","relation":"reply"},{"source":"1873354627812602088","target